Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Exercise 3.23", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"7d6ede62-4370-4645-b1d1-ca76e844d47a"],

Cell["\<\
The Deuring normal form y^2 + a x y + y = x^3: (0, 0) is a point of order 3, \
the curve is singular exactly when a^3 = 27, and j = a^3 (a^3 - 24)^3/(a^3 - \
27). Check it for a = 2 (j = 32768/19) and a = 3.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fbe964e7-9535-4310-a1d4-0b2ddc461c7e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["ECPFindPointOrder[{0, 0}, {2, 0, 1, 0, 0}]", "Input",
