Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Exercise 5.15", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"19964e42-1956-4dd8-b380-d1e7017f9c0a"],

Cell["\<\
For a supersingular curve over F_p, #E(F_(p^n)) = p^n + 1 for n odd and \
(p^(n/2) - (-1)^(n/2))^2 for n even. For y^2 = x^3 + x over F_7 this gives 8, \
64, 344.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"025ea8af-e9ff-4980-b3cd-cbf963aed899"],

