Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Exercise 8.17", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"544c3fe5-a462-489e-9231-3a8e8546f308"],

Cell["\<\
The curves y^2 = x^3 + d^2 A x + d^3 B all have the same j-invariant. With A \
= -2, B = 1 the torsion is Z/2 for every squarefree d except d = 1 and d = 5, \
where it is Z/4.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"14a2d1cc-939f-424c-80b4-fbae7eff5872"],

