Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Exercise 9.13", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"f7b8dd0a-19bf-4d37-9c7b-5c134a176e59"],

Cell["\<\
E : y^2 + y = x^3 - x. (a) E(Q) has no torsion. (b) E(Q) is generated by (0, \
0) (rank 1, Exercise 10.9). (c) The integral points have x = -1, 0, 1, 2, 6. \
(d) The only positive integers that are products of two and of three \
consecutive integers are 6 = 2.3 = 1.2.3 and 210 = 14.15 = 5.6.7.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"587ad32e-e137-4fde-9e79-9735013d3738"],

