Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Exercise 10.23", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"8e09aa44-4970-48ca-80e4-9618139cf677"],

Cell["\<\
The Neumann-Setzer curves y^2 = x^3 + a x^2 - 16x with p = a^2 + 64 prime. \
For a = 5, p = 89: the minimal discriminant is p, the conductor is p, and \
E(Q) = Z/2.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"62bef0cc-7d35-4dd4-b8ae-4aad1645364d"],

