Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Exercise 11.7", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"f795c9af-1382-46ef-b97d-06a7da6ba057"],

Cell["\<\
Lenstra's algorithm: (a) N = 589, y^2 = x^3 + 4x + 9; (b) N = 26167, y^2 = \
x^3 + 4x + 128; (c) N = 1386493, y^2 = x^3 + 3x - 3; (d) N = 28102844557, y^2 \
= x^3 + 18x - 453. The factor that is found is the prime for which #E(F_p) \
has only small prime factors: 19, 191, 1297 and 117763.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c28a5cbb-74b0-4a9a-9e27-3b06373bc5b8"],

